# History entries prior to 11.0

4 August 2021 Ben Morgan (test61-V10-07-05)
---------------------------------------------------
- Modernize CMake script allowing test to be built in system testing
  or as a standalone project

5 May 2021 Ben Morgan (test61-V10-07-04)
----------------------------------------
- Do not install tests

18 March 2021 Alberto Ribon (test61-V10-07-03)
----------------------------------------------
- Tst61PhysicsList : replaced G4HadronCaptureProcess with
  G4NeutronCaptureProcess.

08 March 2021 Alberto Ribon (test61-V10-07-02)
----------------------------------------------
- Tst61PhysicsList : replaced old ion cross sections (that have been
  deleted) with G4ComponentGGNuclNuclXsc.

04 March 2021 Alberto Ribon (test61-V10-07-01)
----------------------------------------------
- Tst61PhysicsList : replaced particle-specific inelastic hadronic
  processes (that have been deleted) with G4HadronInelasticProcess.

18 February 2021 Ben Morgan (test61-V10-07-00)
----------------------------------------------
- Support same CMake version range as core Geant4

09 May 2019 Vladimir Ivanchenko (test61-V10-05-00)
---------------------------------------------------
- use Shielding PhysicsList and Mixmax random engine

09 August 2018  A. Ribon      (test61-V10-04-00)
---------------------------------------------------
- Tst61PhysicsList : replaced the explicit high-energy limit of hadronic
  physics with the one from G4HadronicParameters .

07 March 2017  V. Ivanchenko  (test61-V10-03-00)
---------------------------------------------------
- Tst61PhysicsList: removed obsolete unused headers

13-October-2016 G.Folger  (test61-V10-02-00)
-----------------------------------------------
- remove direct use of theParticleIterator, use GetParticleTableIterator().
    fix required by clang39 on Linux and MAC

29 July 2015  Tatsumi Koi  (test61-V10-01-00)
-----------------------------------------------
- Use parameterised volume for changing material of target box

22 July 2013  Dennis Wright  (test61-V09-06-04)
-----------------------------------------------
- Tst61PhysicsList: remove fission (redundant) and replace G4LCapture model
  with G4NeutronRadCapture

3 July 2013  Dennis Wright  (test61-V09-06-03)
----------------------------------------------
- Tst61PhysicsList: complete the removal of LEP models and clean up

12 June 2013  Dennis Wright (test61-V09-06-02)
----------------------------------------------
- Migrate to multi-threaded:
    added option to use G4MTRunManager in test61.cc
    created class Tst61ActionInitialization and moved some user init methods
      there
    added empty method Tst18GeometryConstruction::ConstructSDandField()

- added CMakeLists_Standalone.txt to be used for stand-alone running
  (developed by Makoto Asai)

- updated README for cmake build

29-Apr-2013  Tatsumi Koi (test61-V09-06-01)
-------------------------------------------
- Replace CLHEP::HepRandom to G4Random
- Add "showEngineStatus" at the end of job

22-Apr-2013  Tatsumi Koi (test61-V09-06-00)
- Replace deprecated hadronic models

30-Oct-2012, Gunter Folger (test61-V09-05-02)
- Use default Precompound, and therefore default setting for de-excitation.

11-Oct-2012, Gabriele Cosmo (test61-V09-05-01)
- Explicit inclusion of units and constants headers.

27-Jul-2012, Vladimir Ivanchenko (test61-V09-05-00)
- Fixed hadron elastic.

07-Nov-2011, Pere Mato (test61-V09-04-01)
